WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.024 --> 00:00:06.439
Let's design your park on a real satellite map. In Site Designer, open the Map tab on a new map.

2
00:00:06.808 --> 00:00:10.151
Type your park's address in the search box, and click Search.

3
00:00:14.475 --> 00:00:16.432
The map flies straight to your park.

4
00:00:16.807 --> 00:00:19.233
Switch to Satellite to see it from above.

5
00:00:20.658 --> 00:00:23.724
Zoom in until you can see the pads and the drive.

6
00:00:26.100 --> 00:00:29.358
Then click Lock Map, and that view becomes your layout.

7
00:00:31.183 --> 00:00:36.254
Now add a space. Pick a size and a surface, and drag it onto a real pad.

8
00:00:38.892 --> 00:00:43.302
Add a few more the same way. Each one drops in the middle, ready to drag.

9
00:00:50.385 --> 00:00:55.286
Drag a green corner to resize a space, and the blue dot to turn it to match the pad.

10
00:00:55.652 --> 00:01:00.083
Each space shows its name, size, price and status, right on the map.

11
00:01:00.462 --> 00:01:05.939
Buildings are just as easy. Click Add Building, choose the Office, and drop it in place.

12
00:01:08.500 --> 00:01:11.118
Add the restroom and shower house the same way.

13
00:01:17.359 --> 00:01:22.921
Drop a sign anywhere guests need one, like the entrance, and a speed limit along the drive.

14
00:01:29.369 --> 00:01:35.230
Then sketch the road in a few moves. Add Road, and drag its two ends to follow the real drive.

15
00:01:38.646 --> 00:01:39.984
Click Save Map.

16
00:01:42.425 --> 00:01:47.539
Then click Lock, so nothing moves by accident. Click Edit any time to change it.

17
00:01:47.897 --> 00:01:51.454
When it's ready, tick LIVE, and guests can book from this map.

18
00:01:51.827 --> 00:01:54.936
Your real park, on a real map, ready for bookings.
